 *
 * @target-controller CommunityController (src/main/java/com/tainted/community/web/CommunityController.java)
 * @target-api POST /internal/posts/{id}/like (handler: like)
 *
 * 외부 연동 없음(detect-external-calls: must_mock=[]). WireMock 대상 없음.
